# A carrier carries a log from the flag toward the castle: fast-forward to the carrier carrying, zoom in on the road, and
# take a shot at the lift and one a moment later on the road.
# Run it on the layout: sh tools/play-run.sh carrier-log --layout layouts/carrier.jsonc --fps 10
wait 0.3
fast-forward carrier carrying max 20000
scroll up 6 860 560
wait 0.3
dump carrying
shot carrying
wait 2
shot on-the-road
